SUMMARY:From Introduction to Opportunity: Effective Networking Skills
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Build meaningful connections that can support your academic and
  career success. Join Career Services for an interactive workshop designed
  to help you develop effective networking skills with confidence.\nLearn p
 ractical strategies for starting conversations\, making strong first impre
 ssions\, maintaining professional relationships\, and expanding your netwo
 rk both on and off campus. Through engaging activities and guided practice
 \, you'll have the opportunity to connect with fellow students while build
 ing skills you can use at career fairs\, employer events\, interviews\, an
 d beyond.\nWhether you're new to networking or looking to strengthen your 
 communication skills\, this session will help you turn introductions into 
 meaningful opportunities for your future career.\n\nStaff in Charge: GCI\n
 Register: https://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/30006101375217
END:VEVENT
