SUMMARY:Meet with Employers
LOCATION:Tempe - MU Arizona
DESCRIPTION:Connect directly with employers and expand your professional ne
 twork. Meet recruiters and hiring representatives from a variety of organi
 zations to learn about their companies\, explore internship and full-time 
 opportunities\, and gain valuable insights into what employers look for in
  candidates.\nThis is your chance to introduce yourself\, ask questions ab
 out career paths\, hiring processes\, workplace culture\, and available op
 portunities\, while practicing your networking skills in a welcoming envir
 onment. Come prepared with your resume\, your elevator pitch\, and questio
 ns to make the most of your conversations.\nWhether you're actively seekin
 g an internship or full-time position\, or simply exploring your career op
 tions\, this event is a great opportunity to build connections and gain fi
 rsthand advice from employers.\n\nStaff in Charge: GCI\nVenue Booking Stat
 us: Booked\nRegister: https://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/3000610137923
 6\nSpecial Event Registry Code: RITM1341393
END:VEVENT
