SUMMARY:Career Winter Social (Make Vision Boards)
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of the semester while preparing for your futu
 re! Join Career Services for a fun and relaxing Winter Social where you'll
  connect with fellow students\, reflect on your accomplishments\, and crea
 te a vision board to map out your academic and career goals for the year a
 head.\nEnjoy a creative\, welcoming environment as you design a vision boa
 rd that represents your aspirations\, whether it's landing an internship\,
  building new skills\, expanding your network\, or achieving personal mile
 stones. Meet other students\, share ideas\, and leave feeling inspired and
  motivated for the next step in your career journey.\nCome unwind\, get cr
 eative\, and start turning your goals into a vision for success!\n\nStaff 
 in Charge: GCI\nRegister: https://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/300061013
 79239
END:VEVENT
